未找到操作令牌。','Invalid action nonce.'=>'无效的操作令牌。','Editorial Comments'=>'编辑评论','Choose Post Types'=>'选择帖子类型','<p>Editorial comments help you cut down on email overload and keep the conversation close to where it matters: your content. Threaded commenting in the admin, similar to what you find at the end of a blog post, allows writers and editors to privately leave feedback and discuss what needs to be changed before publication.</p><p>Anyone with access to view the story in progress will also have the ability to comment on it. If you have notifications enabled, those following the post will receive an email every time a comment is left.</p>'=>'<p>编辑评论帮助您减少电子邮件过载，并将对话保持在重要的地方：您的内容。管理后台的线程评论，类似于您在博客文章末尾找到的内容，允许作者和编辑私下留下反馈，并讨论在发布之前需要更改的内容。</p><p>任何有权查看正在进行的故事的人也将有能力对此进行评论。如果您启用了通知，关注该帖子的用户会在每次留下评论时收到电子邮件。</p>','<p><strong>For more information:</strong></p><p><a href="https://publishpress.com/features/editorial-comments/">Editorial Comments Documentation</a></p><p><a href="https://github.com/ostraining/PublishPress">PublishPress on Github</a></p>'=>'<p><strong>更多信息：</strong></p><p><a href="https://publishpress.com/features/editorial-comments/">编辑评论文档</a></p><p><a href="https://github.com/ostraining/PublishPress">Github 上的 PublishPress</a></p>','Remove'=>'移除','All Posts'=>'所有帖子','All Users'=>'所有用户','Search results for &#8220;%s&#8221;'=>'“%s”的搜索结果','Search Comments'=>'搜索评论','You can add editorial comments to a post once you\'ve saved it for the first time.'=>'您可以在第一次保存帖子后添加编辑评论。','Add an editorial comment'=>'添加编辑评论','Attach file'=>'附件','Add Comment'=>'添加评论','Reply to this comment'=>'回复此评论','Reply'=>'回复','Delete'=>'删除','said on %1$s at %2$s'=>'在 %1$s 于 %2$s 说','Nonce check failed. Please ensure you\'re supposed to be adding editorial comments.'=>'Nonce 检查失败。请确保您有权添加编辑评论。','Invalid comment data'=>'无效的评论数据','Sorry, you don\'t have the privileges to add editorial comments. Please talk to your Administrator.'=>'抱歉，您没有添加编辑评论的权限。请与您的管理员联系。','Please enter a comment.'=>'请输入评论。','There was a problem of some sort. Try again or contact your administrator.'=>'出现了一些问题。请重试或联系您的管理员。','Nonce check failed. Please ensure you\'re supposed to be editing editorial comments.'=>'Nonce 检查失败。请确保您有权编辑编辑评论。','Sorry, you don\'t have the privileges to edit editorial comments. Please talk to your Administrator.'=>'抱歉，您没有编辑编辑评论的权限。请与您的管理员联系。','Sorry, you don\'t have the privileges to edit this editorial comment. Please talk to your Administrator.'=>'抱歉，您没有权限编辑此编辑评论。请与您的管理员联系。','Sorry, you don\'t have the privileges to delete this editorial comment. Please talk to your Administrator.'=>'抱歉，您没有权限删除此编辑评论。请与您的管理员联系。','Sorry, you can\'t delete this editorial comment because it has some replies.'=>'抱歉，您无法删除此编辑评论，因为它有一些回复。','Comment deleted successfully.'=>'评论已成功删除。','Enable for these post types:'=>'为以下帖子类型启用：','Comment author name field:'=>'评论作者姓名字段：','Nickname'=>'昵称','Username'=>'用户名','Display Name'=>'显示名称','First Name'=>'名字','Last Name'=>'姓氏','Email'=>'电子邮件','User Url'=>'用户网址','No editorial comments.'=>'没有编辑评论。','Filter by post'=>'按帖子过滤','Filter by user'=>'按用户过滤','Filter'=>'筛选','Comment'=>'评论','Post'=>'帖子','Submitted on'=>'提交于','%1$s at %2$s'=>'%1$s 在 %2$s','Editorial fields term added.'=>'编辑字段术语已添加。','Editorial fields term updated.'=>'编辑字段术语已更新。','Editorial fields term doesn\'t exist.'=>'编辑字段术语不存在。','Editorial fields term deleted.'=>'编辑字段术语已删除。','Editorial fields order updated.'=>'编辑字段顺序已更新。','Editorial fields visibility changed.'=>'编辑字段的可见性已更改。','<p>Keep track of important details about your content with editorial fields. This feature allows you to create as many date, text, number, etc. fields as you like, and then use them to store information like contact details or the location of an interview.</p><p>Once you’ve set your fields up, editorial fields integrates with both the calendar and the content overview. Make an editorial fields item visible to have it appear to the rest of your team. Keep it hidden to restrict the information between the writer and their editor.</p>'=>'<p>通过编辑字段跟踪有关您内容的重要细节。此功能允许您创建任意数量的日期、文本、数字等字段，然后使用它们存储信息，如联系信息或访谈地点。</p><p>一旦设置了字段，编辑字段会与日历和内容概述集成。使编辑字段项目可见，以便让您的团队其他成员看到。保持其隐藏以限制作者和编辑之间的信息。</p>','<p><strong>For more information:</strong></p><p><a href="https://publishpress.com/features/editorial-metadata/">Editorial Fields Documentation</a></p><p><a href="https://github.com/ostraining/PublishPress">PublishPress on Github</a></p>'=>'<p><strong>更多信息：</strong></p><p><a href="https://publishpress.com/features/editorial-metadata/">编辑字段文档</a></p><p><a href="https://github.com/ostraining/PublishPress">Github上的PublishPress</a></p>','First Draft Date'=>'初稿日期','When the first draft needs to be ready.'=>'初稿需要准备好的时间。','Assignment'=>'任务分配','What the post needs to cover.'=>'帖子需要涵盖的内容。','Checkbox'=>'复选框','Dropdown Select'=>'下拉选择','Location'=>'位置','Number'=>'数字','Paragraph'=>'段落','Text'=>'文本','User'=>'用户','Are you sure you want to delete this term? Any metadata for this term will remain but will not be visible unless this term is re-added.'=>'您确定要删除此术语吗？该术语的任何元数据将保留，但除非此术语重新添加，否则将不可见。','Search Editorial Fields'=>'搜索编辑字段','Popular Editorial Fields'=>'热门编辑字段','All Editorial Fields'=>'所有编辑字段','Edit Editorial Fields'=>'编辑编辑字段','Update Editorial Fields'=>'更新编辑字段','Add New Editorial Fields'=>'添加新的编辑字段','New Editorial Fields'=>'新的编辑字段','No editorial fields available.'=>'没有可用的编辑字段。',' <a href="%s">Add fields to get started</a>.'=>' <a href="%s">添加字段以开始</a>。',' Encourage your site administrator to configure your editorial workflow by adding editorial fields.'=>'鼓励您的网站管理员通过添加编辑字段来配置您的编辑工作流程。','All options value and labels are required.'=>'所有选项的值和标签都是必需的。','Please enter a name for the editorial fields.'=>'请输入编辑字段的名称。','Please enter a slug for the editorial fields.'=>'请输入编辑字段的别名。','Name conflicts with existing term. Please choose another.'=>'名称与现有术语冲突。请选择其他名称。','Name already in use. Please choose another.'=>'名称已在使用中。请选择其他名称。','Slug already in use. Please choose another.'=>'别名已在使用中。请选择其他名称。','Name cannot exceed 200 characters. Please try a shorter name.'=>'名称不能超过200个字符。请尝试一个更短的名称。','Please select a valid metadata type.'=>'请选择有效的元数据类型。','Error adding term.'=>'添加术语时出错。','Please enter a name for the editorial fields'=>'请输入编辑字段的名称','Please enter a valid, non-numeric name for the editorial fields.'=>'请输入有效的非数字名称作为编辑字段。','Metadata name conflicts with existing term. Please choose another.'=>'元数据名称与现有术语冲突。请选择其他名称。','Name conflicts with slug for another term. Please choose something else.'=>'名称与另一个术语的别名冲突。请选择其他名称。','Error updating term.'=>'更新术语时出错。','Terms not set.'=>'未设置条款。','Error deleting term.'=>'删除条款时出错。','Register editorial fields for these post types:'=>'为这些帖子类型注册编辑字段：','No'=>'否','Yes'=>'是','This editorial fields type is not yet supported.'=>'此编辑字段类型尚不支持。','Not set'=>'未设置','View &#8220;%s&#8221; on Google Maps'=>'在 Google 地图上查看“%s”','-- Select %s --'=>'-- 选择 %s --','-- Select a user --'=>'-- 选择用户 --','Position'=>'职位','Name'=>'姓名','Post Types'=>'帖子类型','Field Type'=>'字段类型','Description'=>'描述','No editorial fields found.'=>'未找到编辑字段。','The name is for labeling the editorial fields.'=>'名称用于标记编辑字段。','Slug'=>'别名','The slug cannot be changed once the term has been created.'=>'一旦创建条款，别名无法更改。','The description can be used to communicate with your team about what the field is for.'=>'描述可用于与您的团队沟通该字段的用途。','Type'=>'类型','The field type cannot be changed once created.'=>'一旦创建，字段类型无法更改。','User role'=>'用户角色','Select roles...'=>'选择角色...','Filter the list of users in the editorial meta to users in the selected roles.'=>'将编辑元数据中的用户列表过滤为所选角色中的用户。','Select Type'=>'选择类型','Single Select'=>'单项选择','Multiple Select'=>'多项选择','Indicate the select type.'=>'指明选择类型。','Dropdown Option'=>'下拉选项','Enter the dropdown option value and label. You can move options to change their order.'=>'输入下拉选项值和标签。您可以移动选项以更改其顺序。','Meta Value'=>'元值','Display Label'=>'显示标签','Default option'=>'默认选项','Add Another Option'=>'添加另一个选项','Show on Content Calendar and Overview form'=>'在内容日历和概览表单上显示','If enabled, this field will be available when adding new 