preview of the scheduled message. The content can still change until the notification is sent.'=>'这是计划消息的预览。内容在通知发送之前仍然可以更改。','Notifications'=>'通知','<p>Notifications ensure you keep up to date with progress your most important content. Users can be subscribed to notifications on a post one by one or by selecting roles.</p><p>When enabled, notifications can be sent when a post changes status or an editorial comment is left by a writer or an editor.</p>'=>'<p>通知确保您与最重要内容的进展保持同步。用户可以逐个订阅帖子通知或通过选择角色进行订阅。</p><p>启用时，当帖子状态更改或作者或编辑留下编辑评论时，可以发送通知。</p>','<p><strong>For more information:</strong></p><p><a href="https://publishpress.com/features/notifications/">Notifications Documentation</a></p><p><a href="https://github.com/ostraining/PublishPress">PublishPress on Github</a></p>'=>'<p><strong>更多信息：</strong></p><p><a href="https://publishpress.com/features/notifications/">通知文档</a></p><p><a href="https://github.com/ostraining/PublishPress">Github上的PublishPress</a></p>','Notify User'=>'通知用户','Notify Users'=>'通知用户','Notify Role'=>'通知角色','Notify Roles'=>'通知角色','Notification Group'=>'通知组','Notification Groups'=>'通知组','Notify Email'=>'通知电子邮件','Notify Emails'=>'通知电子邮件','Click to stop being notified on updates for this post'=>'点击以停止接收此帖子的更新通知','Stop notifying me'=>'停止通知我','Click to start being notified on updates for this post'=>'点击以开始接收此帖子的更新通知','Notify me'=>'通知我','Enter users, roles, or email addresses that should receive notifications for this post.'=>'输入应接收此帖通知的用户、角色或电子邮件地址。','Show active notifications'=>'显示活动通知','This won\'t have any effect unless you have at least one workflow targeting the "Users who selected "Notify me" for the content" option.'=>'除非您至少有一个工作流针对“选择“通知我”的用户内容”选项，否则这不会有任何效果。','Active Notifications'=>'活动通知','Workflow has users enrolled'=>'工作流中有用户已注册','No active notifications found for this %s.'=>'未找到此 %s 的活动通知。','You are receiving this email because you are subscribed to "%s".'=>'您收到此电子邮件是因为您订阅了 "%s"。','This email was sent %s.'=>'此电子邮件于 %s 发送。','Show the "Notify me" and "Stop notifying me" links for these post types:'=>'显示这些帖子类型的 "通知我" 和 "停止通知我" 链接：','Email from:'=>'来自电子邮件：','Always notify the author of the content:'=>'始终通知内容作者：','Always notify users who have edited the content:'=>'始终通知编辑过内容的用户：','Blacklisted taxonomies for Notifications'=>'通知的黑名单分类法','slug1,slug2'=>'slug1,slug2','Add a list of taxonomy-slugs separated by comma that should not be loaded by the Taxonomy content filter when adding a new Notification Workflow.'=>'添加一个以逗号分隔的分类法标识符列表，这些标识符在添加新的通知工作流时不应由分类内容过滤器加载。','WordPress Scheduler'=>'WordPress 调度程序','[%1$s] New %2$s Created: "%3$s"'=>'[%1$s] 新 %2$s 创建: "%3$s"','A new %1$s (#%2$s "%3$s" ) was created by %4$s %5$s'=>'新 %1$s (#%2$s "%3$s" ) 是由 %4$s %5$s 创建的','[%1$s] %2$s Trashed: "%3$s"'=>'[%1$s] %2$s 已移至垃圾箱: "%3$s"','%1$s #%2$s "%3$s" was moved to the trash by %4$s %5$s'=>'%1$s #%2$s "%3$s" 已被 %4$s %5$s 移至垃圾箱','[%1$s] %2$s Restored (from Trash ): "%3$s"'=>'[%1$s] %2$s 已恢复 (从垃圾箱): "%3$s"','%1$s #%2$s "%3$s" was restored from trash by %4$s %5$s'=>'%1$s #%2$s "%3$s" 已被 %4$s %5$s 从垃圾箱恢复','[%1$s] %2$s Published: "%3$s"'=>'[%1$s] %2$s 已发布: "%3$s"','%1$s #%2$s "%3$s" was published by %4$s %5$s'=>'%1$s #%2$s "%3$s" 是由 %4$s %5$s 发布的','[%1$s] %2$s Unpublished: "%3$s"'=>'[%1$s] %2$s 未发布: "%3$s"','%1$s #%2$s "%3$s" was unpublished by %4$s %5$s'=>'%1$s #%2$s "%3$s" 被 %4$s %5$s 未发布','[%1$s] %2$s Status Changed for "%3$s"'=>'[%1$s] %2$s 状态已更改为 "%3$s"','Status was changed for %1$s #%2$s "%3$s" by %4$s %5$s'=>'状态已由 %4$s %5$s 更改 %1$s #%2$s "%3$s"','This action was taken on %1$s at %2$s %3$s'=>'此操作于 %1$s 在 %2$s %3$s 进行','%1$s => %2$s'=>'%1$s => %2$s','== %s Details =='=>'== %s 详情 ==','Title: %s'=>'标题: %s','Author: %1$s (%2$s )'=>'作者: %1$s (%2$s )','== Actions =='=>'== 操作 ==','Add editorial comment: %s'=>'添加编辑评论: %s','Edit: %s'=>'编辑: %s','View: %s'=>'查看: %s','[%1$s] New Editorial Comment: "%2$s"'=>'[%1$s] 新编辑评论: "%2$s"','A new editorial comment was added to %3$s #%1$s "%2$s"'=>'已添加新编辑评论到 %3$s #%1$s "%2$s"','%1$s (%2$s ) said on %3